'Bell Avenue 商业街':'Bell Avenue shops', '商业':'Shops',
'正门对面、隔着 Jalan Sunsuria 的一整排三层店屋，北排朝大路，南排朝后巷，中间有两条穿行小巷，东头是 Bell Suites 公寓。星爸爸咖啡、31 冰淇淋、蜜雪冰橙、螺蛳粉、麻辣烫都在这排（店名都是谐音或通用名，顺序照真实地图）。':'A long row of three-storey shophouses across Jalan Sunsuria from the main gate: the north row faces the road, the south row the back lane, with two alleys between and Bell Suites at the east end. Starbucks-ish coffee, 31 ice cream, Mixue, luosifen and mala tang are all here (names are puns or generic; order follows the real map).',
'Taman Warisan Megah 住宅区':'Taman Warisan Megah', '住宅':'Housing',
'Bell Avenue 后面的双层排屋和几栋矮公寓，很多同学在这里租房住。正对校门那一排每户门口都有车棚，挂着「出售」牌子的可以买下来装修（js/89-house.js）。':'Double-storey terraces and a few low flats behind Bell Avenue, where many students rent. The row facing the gate has carports; houses with a "For Sale" sign can be bought and decorated.',
'蜜雪冰橙（Bell Avenue）':'Mixue (Bell Avenue)', 'Bell Suites 公寓':'Bell Suites', 'Bell Avenue 后巷':'Bell Avenue back lane',
'KIP 购物中心':'KIP Mall', '商场':'Mall',
'照雪邦 KIPMall Kota Warisan 按 OpenStreetMap 的轮廓 1:1 搭的两层商场：北面朝停车场，正中是挂着 KIPMALL 红字的大门，西北角是炸鸡店和 Gate A 玻璃门厅，屋顶铺着太阳能板。里面有超市、亲子乐园、美食广场。真实离校门直线大约 1.3 公里（开车要绕更远），这里压缩成从校门开车半分钟，要翻过一道山坡。':'A two-storey mall built 1:1 from KIPMall Kota Warisan\'s OpenStreetMap outline: the north side faces the car park, the main door carries the red KIPMALL letters, the fried-chicken shop and glass Gate A lobby are at the north-west corner, and solar panels cover the roof. Inside: a supermarket, kids\' park and food court. In reality it\'s about 1.3 km from the gate as the crow flies; here it\'s a 30-second drive over a hill.',
'KIP Sentral 店屋':'KIP Sentral shophouses',
'KIP 商场后巷对面的一排排三层店屋（KIP Sentral），门口斜着停车，楼上多是小旅馆和诊所。这里搭了离商场最近的第一排，四栋，照真实的街道 Jalan Warisan Sentral 1、2、4 排开。':'Rows of three-storey shophouses (KIP Sentral) across the mall\'s back lane, with angled parking and mostly small hotels and clinics upstairs. The first row nearest the mall is built here, four blocks along the real Jalan Warisan Sentral 1, 2 and 4.',
'公寓':'Apartments',
'KIP Sentral 东南角的 SoHo 公寓：四层的停车裙楼上立着 A、B 两栋高楼，裙楼顶上有泳池。整片 KIP 一带最显眼的高楼。':'The SoHo apartments at KIP Sentral\'s south-east corner: towers A and B on a four-storey car-park podium with a rooftop pool. The tallest landmark around KIP.',
'KIP 商场对面山坡下的四层公寓（A、B、C、D 栋和两栋没编号的），一条小环路绕着它们。':'Four-storey flats on the slope opposite KIP Mall (blocks A–D and two unnumbered ones), circled by a small loop road.',
'KIP CORE 公寓':'KIP CORE Apartments',
'麦当当':'McDonald\'s', '快餐':'Fast food', '麦当当 24h':'McDonald\'s 24h',
'KIP Sentral 店屋最南头、顺着 Jalan Warisan Sentral 1 开到底的 24 小时快餐店，旁边就是加油站。真实在 KIP 商场正南大约 600 米（离校门直线约 1.7 公里），这里压缩到店屋街区的南头。路边立着高高的汉堡招牌，还有得来速车道。名字是谐音，照那家快餐店搭的。':'The 24-hour fast-food place at the south end of KIP Sentral, at the end of Jalan Warisan Sentral 1, next to the petrol station. In reality it\'s about 600 m south of KIP Mall (1.7 km from the gate); here it\'s squeezed to the end of the shophouses. A tall burger sign stands by the road, and there\'s a drive-thru lane.',
'加油站':'Petrol station',
'麦当当旁边的加油站和 24 小时便利店，照真实的那家搭的外观（黄红两色的加油棚），不能加油。真实在麦当当正南边，地图到这里就到头了，所以放在它东边。':'The petrol station and 24-hour mart next to McDonald\'s, modelled on the real one (yellow-and-red canopy). You can\'t refuel. In reality it\'s south of McDonald\'s, but the map ends there, so it sits to the east.',
