'热熔胎皮':'Soft compound', '调校芯片':'Tuning chip', '避震套件':'Suspension kit', '改装图纸':'Blueprint', '航空钛锭':'Aero titanium', '赛道引擎核心':'Race engine core',
'送外卖、得来速、每天第一次打卡；投篮和食堂端盘子按奖牌给':'Deliveries, drive-thru, first check-in each day; Hoops and Canteen Rush by medal',
'得来速、蜜雪冰橙打工、挑战赛、顺风车、喷漆车间甩警戒、惊险擦车和大跳慢动作、特技连击、每天第一次打卡':'Drive-thru, Mixue shifts, challenges, rides, losing the alert at the spray shop, near misses and big-jump slow-mo, stunt combos, first check-in each day',
'宿舍撤离、送夜宵、蜜雪冰橙打工、顺风车好评':'Dorm raids, late-night deliveries, Mixue shifts, good ride ratings',
