'买房装修':'Houses & decor',
'出南门往南走，Bell Avenue 后面那排带车棚的排屋（Taman Warisan Megah）有四户挂着<b>「出售」</b>牌子，小地图上是<span class="gd-dot" style="--c:#38c6d9"></span>青色点。':'Head south out of the South Gate: in the row of terrace houses with carports behind Bell Avenue (Taman Warisan Megah), four have a <b>"For Sale"</b> sign; they\'re the <span class="gd-dot" style="--c:#38c6d9"></span>cyan dots on the minimap.',
'走到门口按 F看房：能先进去转一圈，买下要 RM 7,400–9,600（按附近真实成交价 ÷ 50）。买下后门牌写你的昵称，按 F进门。':'Press F at the door to view: you can look around first; buying costs RM 7,400–9,600 (real local prices ÷ 50). Once it\'s yours, the door plate shows your nickname; press F to go in.',
'家里按 F：先选风格（学生宿舍风、北欧原木、中式红木、电竞房、奶娃主题），九个位置的家具一件件买，墙面和地板另外换。走到沙发、椅子、床、灶台旁边按 F能<b>坐下、躺下、做饭</b>。电竞房有几件要<b>改装道具</b>，奶娃主题要解锁够多<b>成就</b>。':'Press F at home: pick a style (student dorm, Nordic wood, Chinese rosewood, gaming room, Naiwa theme), buy furniture for nine spots piece by piece, and change walls and floors separately. Press F by a sofa, chair, bed or stove to <b>sit, lie down or cook</b>. Some gaming-room pieces need <b>mod parts</b>; the Naiwa theme needs enough <b>achievements</b>.',
'房子、家具、墙面地板都按原价算进<b>总资产</b>。开着自己的车到车棚前下车，车自动停进车棚，下次上线还在。第一套房子自动设成<b>出生点</b>，打开游戏就在家门口（装修面板顶上能改）。':'The house, furniture, walls and floors all count toward <b>net worth</b> at purchase price. Get out of your own car at the carport and it parks itself, still there next time. Your first house becomes your <b>spawn point</b>, so you start at your door (change it at the top of the decor panel).',
'看地图':'The map',
'按 <kbd>M</kbd> 打开大地图：拖动平移，滚轮或「＋ −」缩放，「回到我」重新跟着你。再按 M 或 Esc 关。':'Press <kbd>M</kbd> for the big map: drag to pan, wheel or "+ −" to zoom, "Find me" to follow you again. M or Esc closes it.',
'屏幕上方的<b>指南针</b>指着现在的目标，旁边写着还有多远。':'The <b>compass</b> at the top points at your current goal and shows the distance.',
'在教学楼、宿舍里面，小地图换成那层楼的平面图。':'Inside teaching blocks and dorms, the minimap shows that floor\'s plan.',
'换电台':'Radio',
'上车自动开电台。点<b>电台小条</b>（电脑在左下角，手机竖着拿在上方）打开面板：选台（霓虹夜驾、芙蓉湖 Lo-fi、赛道 EDM）、下一首、单曲循环、收藏到这辆车（下次坐进这辆车接着放）、音量。':'The radio turns on when you get in. Tap the <b>radio strip</b> (bottom left on computers, top on phones held upright) for the panel: station (Neon Night Drive, Lotus Lake Lo-fi, Track EDM), next song, loop, save to this car (plays again next time you get in), volume.',
'按钮栏里的<b>「电台」</b>一点换一个台，换到最后一个是关。':'The <b>"Radio"</b> button switches station; the last one is off.',
'<b>外放</b>：自己听免费；打开外放每分钟 RM 0.5，40 米内的玩家都听得到。':'<b>Speakers</b>: listening yourself is free; playing it out loud costs RM 0.5 a minute and players within 40 m hear it.',
'可以勾「竞速和被保安追时自动切到赛道 EDM」。':'You can tick "switch to Track EDM in races and chases".',
'存档和登录':'Saves & sign-in',
'进度自动存在这台设备的浏览器里。换手机、清缓存就没了。':'Progress saves automatically in this device\'s browser. A new phone or cleared cache loses it.',
'标题页昵称下面点<b>「用 Google 登录」</b>：进度存到云端，换设备登录同一个账号就同步回来；两边进度不一样时，以进度多的一边为准。':'Tap <b>"Sign in with Google"</b> under the nickname on the title screen: progress goes to the cloud and syncs back when you sign in on another device; if the two differ, the one with more progress wins.',
'在微信、QQ 里打开的用不了 Google 登录：点右上角「···」→「在浏览器打开」。':'Google sign-in doesn\'t work inside WeChat or QQ: tap "···" at the top right → "Open in browser".',
'昵称填好就会注册，先到先得；联网时排行榜和展台上显示的都是注册的昵称。':'Your nickname registers as soon as you set it, first come first served; online, leaderboards and the showcase show registered nicknames.',
